=2 Walkthrough
* Once you accept the assignment, the {n:Task Delegator} will provide you with a {k:Mar. FS building mat. container} to deliver to a Station Administrator in {z:Marjami Ravine}.
** As of the {p:Feb. 18 2014 Version Update|http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}, Waypoints can now be used to complete this task without risk of break. Simply warp to a Station Administrator.

+ Zone to {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} from {z:Western Adoulin}.
+ Travel to {z:Sih Gates} in the southwest.
+ Take the western exit from {z:Sih Gates} to {z:Foret de Hennetiel} using {k:"Climbing"} if you can, and head across the colonization reive towards Waypoint 4.
+ Head southwest from Waypoint 4 to enter {z:Doh Gates}.
+ Travel Northwest (counter-clockwise path) to exit into {z:Marjami Ravine}.
+ From the entrance of {z:Marjami Ravine}, follow the path forwards a short distance and speak to the {n:Station Administrator} to complete the assignment.

* Return to the {n:Task Delegator} to receive your reward (you may use Waypoints again now).

=2 Notes
* {p:http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40059-Feb-18-2014-%28JST%29-Version-Update?p=493165&viewfull=1#post493165}
* Movement speed increasing effects recommended.
* Completing this assignment presumably aids with the construction of the Frontier Station in {z:Marjami Ravine}.

